    function testFuzz_property(address potentialCaller) public {
        // Keep domain wide but avoid zero address when calling setCaller later—owner can be zero initially but we want to exercise transfer
        // We will attempt to setCaller via the contract owner; the contract deployer (this) is the initial owner per constructor.
        // Make potentialCaller non-zero to pass setCaller require in setCaller implementation when used.
        vm.assume(potentialCaller != address(0));

        // The property: calling owner() should return the actual stored owner value.
